{{ template "ledgerheader" .}}
<div class="card"><div class="card-header">Experiment Status and Results</div><div class="card-body"><p>This page is read-only. System operators create experiments and change their status through <code>cmd/report-experiment</code>. Results come from append-only, idempotent observations of registered exposures and are deleted after expiry by a controlled retention job. Experiments do not automatically change bids or budgets.</p><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-sm table-hover"><thead><tr><th>ID / Version</th><th>Name</th><th>Owner</th><th>Status</th><th>Primary Metric: Records / Total</th><th>Guardrail Metric: Records / Total</th><th>Retention / Start / End</th><th>Variant Results</th><th>Exposures / Latest Exposure</th><th>Stop Reason</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{range .Lists}}<tr><td>{{.experiment_id}} / {{.experiment_version}}</td><td>{{.experiment_name}}</td><td>{{.owner_type}} {{.adv_id}}</td><td>{{.status}}</td><td>{{.primary_metric}}: {{.primary_outcomes}} / {{.primary_value}}</td><td>{{.guardrail_metric}}: {{.guardrail_outcomes}} / {{.guardrail_value}}</td><td>{{.retention_hours}} hours / {{.starts_at}} / {{.ends_at}}</td><td>{{.variant_results}}</td><td>{{.exposures}} / {{.last_exposure_at}}</td><td>{{.stop_reason}}</td></tr>{{end}}</tbody></table></div><p>Variant results show, in order, allocation basis points, exposures, primary-metric record count/total, and guardrail-metric record count/total.</p></div></div>
{{ template "footer" }}
